{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "nav",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# GameFeature / Experience｜结构图\n服务器装配关系；先后顺序见 [[GGYGO_流程_GameFeature.canvas|流程图]]；[[GameFeature/结构|结构文档]]。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 1450,
      "height": 130,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "experience",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## UGGYGOExperienceDefinition\nGameFeature 插件列表 → 本局加载项；默认 SquadMembers → 无编队时的回退名单。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 290,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 200,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "feature",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## UGameFeaturesSubsystem（UE）\n`LoadAndActivateGameFeaturePlugin(URL, Callback)` → 异步激活；回调成功/失败均返回 GameMode。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 650,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 215,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "gm",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## AGGYGOGameMode\n`InitGame()` → 取得 Experience。\n`ActivateGameFeatures()` → 发起插件激活。\n`HandleStartingNewPlayer()` → 未就绪先排队。\n`SpawnSquadForPlayer()` → Slot→Pawn 两阶段装配。",
      "x": 520,
      "y": 390,
      "width": 470,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "pawn",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## UGGYGOPawnData\n`PawnClass` → 实体类型。\n`AbilitySets` / 组规则 → Slot ASC。\n`MovementSet` / `InputConfig` / `DefaultCameraMode` → Pawn 组件。",
      "x": 1100,
      "y": 220,
      "width": 410,
      "height": 245,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "teams",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## UGGYGOSquadComponent / CharacterSlot\n`SetRoster()` → 局内成员意图。\n`RegisterSlot()` → 接收生成结果。\n`InitializeForPawnData()` → 授予能力。[[Teams/结构]]",
      "x": 1100,
      "y": 580,
      "width": 410,
      "height": 235,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "avatar",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## AGGYGOCharacterBase / PawnExtension\n生成 Pawn 后调用 `SetPawnData()`、`AttachAvatar()` / `InitializeAbilitySystem()` 建立 Owner/Avatar；[[Character/结构]]。",
      "x": 1100,
      "y": 940,
      "width": 410,
      "height": 235,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "asset",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## UGGYGOAssetManager\n项目级共享资产入口；具体资产就绪与兜底约束见 [[模块参考]]。",
      "x": 520,
      "y": 900,
      "width": 470,
      "height": 195,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "contract",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Experience 装配接口契约\nGameMode::InitGame → 读 Experience；ActivateGameFeatures → GameFeaturesSubsystem::LoadAndActivateGameFeaturePlugin(URL, Callback)。\nOnGameFeatureActivated 更新 PendingGameFeatureCount；完成后 SpawnSquadForPendingPlayers。HandleStartingNewPlayer_Implementation 负责未就绪排队。\nSpawnSquadForPlayer → SpawnSquadSlot(PawnData) → InitializeForPawnData/AbilitySet；再 SpawnSquadMember → SetPawnData/AttachAvatar/Possess。\nExperience 是资产配置；GameMode 是权威装配器，PawnData 下发给对应组件。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1270,
      "width": 1450,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "6"
    }
  ],
  "edges": [
